{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18d0_level_act18d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act18d0",
  "stageId": "act18d0_08",
  "title": "大雪將至",
  "storyCode": "WD-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d0/level_act18d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "58a5c6c11e696555baa915a45d896fa7b899883f9a86b7f4be46d1f043472110",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "十三年前\n8:09 P.M.  天氣/大雪\n維多利亞邊境自治郡，多倫郡，文森特莊園"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是一座偉大的城市，任何維多利亞人都應當抽空去瞻仰那座偉大的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附庸風雅的男人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_177",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼說，我們可敬的公爵們依舊沒有討論出結果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，依舊沒有，倫蒂尼姆依舊是一座“無主”的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歡快的女貴族",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那您是有幸和諾曼第公爵一同遊覽倫蒂尼姆了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜，大公爵曾被立法禁止進入倫蒂尼姆，而紳士如公爵閣下，自然不會擅自作出這類僭越之舉。我們只好在倫蒂尼姆郊外的艦船上共進晚餐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "微醺的商人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_176",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "公爵閣下是位怎樣的英雄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......公爵閣下真是個溫和儒雅的貴族，他對經濟與政治都有獨到的見解，不僅如此，聽聞他還精通音律，他個人的收藏室又顯示出他對藝術的崇敬之心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_170_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正因為我們有那麼多這樣的英雄，維多利亞才能依舊繁榮昌盛呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "沒有最高統治者的維多利亞，保持了十數年的穩定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但事實上，幾位大公爵暗中掣肘，相互摩擦，他們甚至還......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果有那麼多貴族會輕易死於食物中毒和狩獵意外，那維多利亞的貴族統治早就崩如散沙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "而三年前，你的父親幾乎親歷了此事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "他的腿受傷了，這不是句謊話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是一位在學術上與爸爸有糾紛的貴族，在一場酒會之後對爸爸下的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "偽裝得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸爸清楚一些苗頭，但他不希望這件事情耽擱情報的輸送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "現在這座莊園裡，有多少是湯姆森的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有很多人，例如剛才和您交談的那幾位......在今夜之前，他們都曾在爸爸的別墅露過面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "......理查剛才可沒少說你父親的壞話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊哈哈......可能理查叔叔有一半說的是真心話吧......他和我爸爸較勁有好多年啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "但他們依舊聚集在湯姆森身邊，你的父親是個很好的領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "離不開您的指導，凱爾希閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰又能想到......當年來到維多利亞的一位拉特蘭修士，會成為我們最信任的導師呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "我們目的相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希，他們會相安無事的，我們會相安無事的，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "......海蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "用你自己的眼睛去看。如果你真的決心走入這片大地，而不再被文明的假象蒙蔽雙眼......你得自己去看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "安慰的話語毫無意義，你會長大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_170_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，我倒是在一些不入流的小貴族和那些地痞流氓之間，聽說了一些讓人不愉快的說法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歡快的女貴族",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，讓您不高興了嗎？伯爵閣下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的......如您所見，各大公爵的禮讓與遷就造就了如今的和平繁榮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但不可否認的是，即使是哥倫比亞那群野蠻的叛徒，他們也能知曉，維多利亞已經很久沒有君王主宰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附庸風雅的男人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_177",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這有何妨呢？這不正說明我們在以......自己的方式強大嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說的沒錯，理查，但有一股聲音，一些天真的，懷著自己目的的人聚集在了一起，他們提出了一個荒唐的問題......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文森特伯爵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_170_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們問，維多利亞當真還有必要去渴求一個新王嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們都說，文森特叔叔太懦弱了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們身處邊境，卻故步自封......明明這正是我們爭取到權益的大好機會，但文森特叔叔只知道在莊園裡召開宴會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這趟倫蒂尼姆之行，也沒有任何實質性的成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "這不會是你父親的意見，湯姆森不至於這麼愚笨，以至於被激進的風氣沖昏了頭腦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但大人們總是這樣對爸爸傾訴意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "沒有任何一個蠢笨的貴族，會受到一位真正的大公爵的召見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "你認為，諾曼第公爵真的沒有對文森特提出一些威逼利誘的條件嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "地處邊境，地廣人稀，正意味著這座無人問津的多倫郡尚不在任何龐大勢力的影響之下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......文森特叔叔他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "這位似乎只懂得歌舞昇平的貴族，在竭力保持多倫郡的和平。儘管這裡的和平......一觸即破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "恰到好處的傲慢與中庸能遮掩他的想法，即使能揣摩到他真實意圖的人寥寥無幾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "湯姆森不會對一個真正沒有膽識和眼力的伯爵如此信任有加，他們看似漸行漸遠，但總是殊途同歸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘿嘿......能聽你這麼說，真好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希，你不用看那兩封信嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "從倫蒂尼姆到多倫郡，幾乎橫跨大半個維多利亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "這份信經過多少人之手，又有多少人知道他們正在參與的事情全貌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很多——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "工人，報童，爆米花小販和公園園丁。而他們根本不知道信裡的內容，甚至連這些文字最終的歸屬都不甚瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "但現在這封信成功交付給了湯姆森，再經由他之手交給了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "那就沒什麼好擔心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是另一封呢？那是“卡茲戴爾”的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "......是一個薩卡茲信使最後親手交給湯姆森的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "雖然我告訴了他湯姆森的聯絡方式，但按照本來的計畫，他應該親手交給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......但那個薩卡茲在抵達維多利亞的時候已經......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸爸不知道如何才能尊重一位薩卡茲英雄的死，只好按我們的習俗火化了他的軀體，抛灑在移動城市的航道上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "......我不能說出他的本名，但至少，他以信使的身份而死，我會把他的故事帶回他的家鄉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "他不會被遺忘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......凱爾希，你是這麼對待每一個人的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "為什麼突然這麼問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我只是覺得......啊......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊嚏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊！抱、抱歉，真不禮貌......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "雪似乎更大了，我們進去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "這場宴會結束之後，我會去拜訪湯姆森的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想，爸爸會高興的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是不是該挽著您的胳膊？這樣其他人才不會起疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你認為有這個必要的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好......嘿嘿，您比我高呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還沒有長大，海蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看外面，凱爾希，多大的雪啊。我好久沒看過這麼大的雪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說的沒錯，風雪將至。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "......黑色的雪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？我怎麼沒看見......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "海蒂，告訴所有同伴，讓他們不留痕跡地控制住宴會現場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "我需要一個小時時間。不要讓任何人......靠近花園。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可以是可以......怎麼這麼突然？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可就算是邊境，這裡可是維多利亞伯爵的莊園，誰敢隨便——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "——海蒂，如果我沒有回到這座莊園，你要與你的父親一併遮掩真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "不要深究這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "這是警告，也是命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_169_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "薩米與烏薩斯以北，薩爾貢以南，那些人類尚未踏足的土地......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "邪魔，精怪，它們是否是尋常的生物都未可知，它們比建立已久的當今諸國更加古老。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "人類對抗它們已有許久，這的確是值得留意的諸多命題之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "......直到如今。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "人已經可以主宰自己的國度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "古老的薩爾貢王與強大的怯薛一拍即合，夢魘的可汗決意征服人類文明尚未探索過的土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "那是一個偉大的結果，再沒有任何非人的威脅膽敢踏入薩爾貢文明的國土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "薩米用無數巫術和犧牲造就了雪祀，一代又一代的女巫在對抗境外之敵的過程中迷失了自我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "而烏薩斯——你們用最強大的少數精銳撕碎了它們。身著重甲的溫迪戈，或是精銳的戰爭術師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "帝國的確野心勃勃。你們不僅僅是撕碎了它們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "你們在利用那些非人之物殘留下的力量碎片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "......現身吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "烏薩斯的意志令你來到此地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "但你是否過於輕蔑了維多利亞的強盛力量，你拖曳著邪魔的步伐，你是否思考過自己的職責所在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "我想，你總不能已經被邪魔吞噬了心智，內衛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_077",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我嗅得到你的恐懼，叛國者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "你花了不少的時間找到我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_077",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......若非叛亂的餘波令我脫不開身，我早該來追殺你這弑主的罪人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_077",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無能者放走了你，這令我蒙羞。而他們都已伏法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "也許我要重新提醒你一遍，風雪能遮掩整座城市，卻仍舊磨滅不去一個內衛的足跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "你身處維多利亞。而我的身後百米有餘，即是一座維多利亞伯爵的宅邸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "你真的清楚你行為的後果——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_077",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——後果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_077",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放棄你軟弱的威脅，我雙足站立之地，便是烏薩斯的偉大國土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_077",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在你說出“邪魔”二字之前，你甚至都沒有與我對話的資格，叛國者。而稍後，我將會清楚你為何知道這最黑暗的秘密......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_077",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你以為你對“邪魔”的瞭解足夠建立起對話的餘地？你背負著弑殺一位烏薩斯大公的罪責，又通曉了至暗的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_077",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶......諸多罪行，足以令你死上萬次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "......看來我們暫且說服不了對方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "但這僅限於......你對現狀的評估。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_077",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "異類，喚出你的爪牙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_077",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你瞞不住我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn08_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn08",
      "text": "......Mon3tr。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": "npc_10002",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（躁動的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mon3tr，別輕敵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他並非普通人類。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "藏在花園之中的......裝置？不......那本身，是一隻生物......嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知曉“邪魔”，現在，又有一隻連烏薩斯最深遠的知識也未曾觸及的怪物環伺身邊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或許，你犯下的累累罪行已經超過了我的預想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又或者，我令一個內衛，感到震撼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不否認，叛國者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但現在我很好奇，是什麼能驅使你這樣的人背叛祖國......不，不，又或者，我倉促的調查並沒能發掘你的全貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來確實如此，比起那些逃往薩米的罪人，你確實留有一手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但千萬別會錯意了......要殺你，依舊易如反掌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你在浸染這裡的空間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我自有分寸，不勞外人提醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——Mon3tr！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（悲鳴）——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶......竟堅硬至此？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倘若你的血肉之軀也有這般強度，我的確無從下手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mon3tr，回來，不要深追。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "避開那些黑色的煙霧。那根本就不是煙霧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這甚至超過了常規法術的範疇......看來我的確太久未曾接觸過帝國的利刃，你們進步神速。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你，對我們的秘密竟知曉到如此地步......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "古老儀式，是，那些自詡得道者的瘋癲助祭，才配為你們披掛邪魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你曾是落日峽谷的倖存者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帝國的意志絕不會有多種面貌，但你確實稍有不同，最少，你並不年輕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們不該以命相搏，內衛。你清楚我唯一做的事情，是你們本該去做，卻無從下手的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要搞錯權力的歸屬，叛國者，你何時能代表聖駿堡的法律和權威？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若是你親歷了整場叛亂，內衛，你更應該明白。帝國的興衰何時真正被尊嚴和體面左右過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，先皇可曾有一刻......發自內心地輕視維多利亞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或許我該高看你一眼，叛國者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最後一次機會。說出你的秘密，換來一份體面的死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很遺憾，任何與自身意志無關的死亡，都不存在體面一說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mon3tr。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（歡快的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶......呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恐懼在膨脹。利刃拔出了利刃。他將踐行烏薩斯的意志。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
